  _data:
    _json: '{"graph":{"variables":{"Kind":"Flow","collection":{"$content":[],"$version":"A"},"$version":"A"},"controlInputDefinitions":[],"controlOutputDefinitions":[],"valueInputDefinitions":[],"valueOutputDefinitions":[],"title":"Encounter - the lender''s men","summary":"The lender sends his men to collect, a handful of times in the life of the debt (Code/Game/Voyage/Collectors.cs; Data/collectors_793.json). Four moments of theirs, each an event here, and what happens at each: his day to send comes; they catch her; she answers them on their card; they give up. Their boat itself (sailing the lanes, asking round a quay, seeing her, rowing for her) is in the code. Their words are in the cards (Data/encounters/wokerer_793.json).","pan":{"x":0.0,"y":0.0},"zoom":1.0,"elements":[{"coroutine":false,"defaultValues":{},"position":{"x":0.0,"y":0.0},"guid":"dd1f1fd8-1487-49e1-87ec-f42994e7a73f","$version":"A","$type":"Kapman.Graphs.OnTheLendersDayToSend","$id":"9"},{"defaultValues":{},"position":{"x":420.0,"y":0.0},"guid":"dded7be0-34b8-4909-9dda-e739c9dbe66f","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.If","$id":"11"},{"defaultValues":{"by":{"$content":1.0,"$type":"System.Double"}},"position":{"x":700.0,"y":-20.0},"guid":"ad50c49a-7c95-4945-a3c0-e91e680d9811","$version":"A","$type":"Kapman.Graphs.LenderCools","$id":"13"},{"defaultValues":{},"position":{"x":700.0,"y":130.0},"guid":"fa29646e-2b0d-4642-9d65-25a521451390","$version":"A","$type":"Kapman.Graphs.LendersMenSetOut","$id":"15"},{"coroutine":false,"defaultValues":{},"position":{"x":0.0,"y":420.0},"guid":"e312db6e-8569-44e7-9a38-e5505428c2d9","$version":"A","$type":"Kapman.Graphs.OnTheLendersMenCatchHer","$id":"17"},{"defaultValues":{},"position":{"x":420.0,"y":420.0},"guid":"5bf3958b-eb49-4c01-9b4d-220a35b4e4b3","$version":"A","$type":"Kapman.Graphs.LendersMenTheirCardComes","$id":"19"},{"coroutine":false,"defaultValues":{},"position":{"x":0.0,"y":800.0},"guid":"9ba977f5-1f5c-40cc-aa92-e413557f68c7","$version":"A","$